\DOC ENSURES_POSTCONDITION_TAC

\TYPE {ENSURES_POSTCONDITION_TAC : term -> tactic}

\SYNOPSIS
Replaces the postcondition of an {ensures} goal by a supplied alternative,
leaving a conjunction of a strengthening implication and the {ensures}
statement for the new postcondition.

\DESCRIBE
The argument {q'} is a {term}: the replacement postcondition, a predicate on
states, used both in the strengthening side condition and in the rewritten
{ensures} conclusion. The precondition and frame are unchanged, the assumptions
{A} are left untouched, and the two postcondition predicates appear unexpanded
as applied lambda terms under the new universally quantified state variable.
{
          A ?- ensures step pre post frame
   ==================================================  ENSURES_POSTCONDITION_TAC q'
    A ?- (forall x1. q' x1 ==> post x1) /\ ensures step pre q' frame
}

\COMMENTS
The observed traces show only this single-goal transformation, applied to
{ensures} goals whose conclusion is left in conjunctive form for later
splitting.

\ENDDOC
